{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23143","headline":"登龙尾道南望忆庐山旧隐 · 白居易","name":"登龙尾道南望忆庐山旧隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙尾道边来一望，香炉峰下去无因。\n青山举眼三千里，白发平头五十人。\n自笑形骸纡组绶，将何言语掌丝纶。\n君恩壮健犹难报，况被年年老逼身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}